+/* The vertex stage already ran on the CPU (the executor's vertex-program
+ * interpreter and fixed-function transform, then its near-plane clip);
+ * nv2a_vk.c turns surface pixels into clip coordinates when it writes the
+ * vertex, so this only passes everything on. */
